	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestHardRestriction	For 2
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestEndOfSupport		For 3
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestServicingTrain	For 4
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestDeferredFeature	For 5
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestDeferredQuality	For 6
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestPausedFeature	For 7
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestPausedQuality	For 8
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestManaged			For 9
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestUnknown			For 10
	Define UpdateAssessmentStatus_NotLatestTargetedVersion	For 11
